units         metal
dimension     3
atom_style    atomic
atom_modify   map array
boundary      p  p  p


pair_style    mlip mlip.ini
read_data     DataOut/MMC0.dat
pair_coeff    *  *

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
thermo 10

timestep     0.00025

compute     pe  all pe
compute     ke  all ke

compute eatoms all pe/atom

fix 1 all nve

